Package: powerlimit
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6, libgtk-4-1, policykit-1 | pkexec
Recommends: nvidia-utils-535 | nvidia-utils-550 | nvidia-utils-560 | nvidia-utils
Maintainer: powerlimit contributors <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ogden-marrow/powerlimit
Description: CPU/GPU power limiter and per-game auto-tuner
 GTK4 app that caps CPU (Intel RAPL) and NVIDIA GPU power to keep a laptop
 cool, and auto-tunes the limits per game by measuring clocks and throttling.
 Built for the Dell XPS 15 9510; may work on other Intel + NVIDIA laptops.
